{%- comment -%}
  CAVIERA Curtain — signature page transition.

  A single global overlay, rendered once in layout/theme.liquid (outside cart-drawer/search-overlay
  so it always sits above them — see --z-transition in assets/caviera-base.css). Real browser
  navigation still does all the work of moving between pages; this is a decorative wrapper around
  it, driven entirely by assets/caviera-page-transition.js and the tiny pre-paint script in
  layout/theme.liquid. It never intercepts cart, checkout, forms, or external links — see the
  exclusion list in caviera-page-transition.js.

  The House Seal at its centre uses mode 'dark' (the bone-coloured mark, correct contrast against
  the Cinnabar field below) — same convention as every other brand-mark render in this theme.
{%- endcomment -%}
<div class="caviera-transition" data-caviera-transition aria-hidden="true">
  <div class="caviera-transition__panel"></div>
  <div class="caviera-transition__mark">
    {%- render 'caviera-house-seal', mode: 'dark', width: 40, loading: 'lazy', alt: '' -%}
  </div>
</div>
